4n rooli ja selvit\u00e4 ep\u00e4ilytt\u00e4v\u00e4n kahvilan mysteeri. Soluttaudu, etsi todistusaineistoa, \u00e4l\u00e4k\u00e4 miss\u00e4\u00e4n nimess\u00e4 j\u00e4\u00e4 kiinni. \n\nPeli on tehty yhteisty\u00f6ss\u00e4 Metropolian kolmannen vuoden opiskelijoiden ja Ylen kanssa. \n\nLue lis\u00e4\u00e4: \nhttps://yle.fi/aihe/historia/kieltolaki \nhttp://gamesblogs.metropolia.fi/salakapakka/", "short_description": "Astu 1920-luvun Helsinkiin ja k\u00e4y tutkimaan salaper\u00e4ist\u00e4 mysteerikahvilaa."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "3092869367412511", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/11162702_760613700793011_4081331521003192320_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ElnoTLnZMaIQ7kNvwETdXRc&_nc_oc=Adqd_y4KBGxWqPd74Tqkx5O7WU8aE12QS6mvcdKV2nlprFzb2JisokTG1KYGOsm5kSw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af6-puFiTMuSoGvcXV-7qilICZ9RB7CI6eNu8WG9OhoTpg&oe=69F9EAD4"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "3052622228115034", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/12386286_555864938090815_4744680728720048128_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=0UgVhFYrPKsQ7kNvwGmRgpy&_nc_oc=AdpZk242DJjwXz8b4F6BRvZMwcNwwVlTrShW6BekW3jK3SuYJqgSYygLj_4F9i53AcE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af7pBKETehkGo9qd4C4Hqct3345S1Pidn-Xrbw0QZ06a0Q&oe=69F9EFB2"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "635734543935653", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/11162754_583536608704930_1984236639773261824_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=k25jMnHuoQ0Q7kNvwFz5t0C&_nc_oc=Adoy8X4of2B-7awD4prPXR0dEqmmZ8pFXBrBI-kBE-N7zHb8s8-zXprFjbZwv_5av5I&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af70OAseUgY2APJLTAljE7hA-J10dk3rhY1-lcoityT_kA&oe=69F9FD55"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.p